TI  - Effectiveness of milk whey protein‐based ready‐to‐use therapeutic food in treatment of severe acute malnutrition in Malawian under‐5 children: a randomised, double‐blind, controlled non‐inferiority clinical trial
AU  - P. Bahwere
AU  - T. Banda
AU  - K. Sadler
AU  - G. Nyirenda
AU  - V. Owino
AU  - B. Shaba
AU  - F. Dibari
