TI  - Effect of diversified meals only, or either enriched with Amaranthus tricolor and Moringa oleifera leaf powder or commercial micronutrient powder on prevention/treatment of anemia in Adivasi children, West Bengal, India
AU  - C. Stiller
AU  - Silvia Konstanze Ellen Golembiewski
AU  - W. Stuetz
AU  - Monika Golembiewski
AU  - D. Rincon
AU  - Srikanta Mondal
