TI  - Adherence to ready-to-use therapeutic food in older children with sickle cell anaemia and severe acute malnutrition: a mixed-methods study in a low-income setting
AU  - Amanda Brechko
AU  - S. Abdullahi
AU  - S. Gambo
AU  - H. Murtala
AU  - H. Kabir
AU  - Khadija A. Shamsu
AU  - Virginia A. Stallings
